            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 21 and 22</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>Which <strong>TWO</strong> parts of the introductory stage to their art projects do Jess and Tom agree were useful?</p>",
